<title>NETHERLANDS: PROVISION CUTS GROOTHANDELSGEBOUWEN NET.</title>
<headline>PROVISION CUTS GROOTHANDELSGEBOUWEN NET.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>First-half 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     0.26 vs   0.55</p>
<p>    Turnover				 5.75 vs   5.55</p>
<p>    Operating costs			5.45 vs   4.82</p>
<p>Note - Property group Groothandelsgebouwen NV </p>
<p>said first-half net profits had been pressured by increased</p>
<p>investments and a one-off 320,000 guilder restructuring</p>
<p>provision (included under operating costs).</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
